        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "标有“POST”的蓝色邮筒图标，在图2的运输网络图中代表通过邮寄返回结果。",
      "lang": "zh",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
